  "title": "Camotes al Horno (Baked Yams)",
  "description": "This camotes al horno recipe features sweet yams simply cooked with butter, honey, and sugar for a warm, rich, side dish that is comforting on its own.",
  "authors": [
    "Alenita"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-04-12T17:23:58-04:00",
